//! Coverage emit submodule.
//!
//! Exposes writers that turn a `CoverageReport` into on-disk artifacts.
//! Currently scaffolded with stubs; full implementations land in
//! phases 2 (LCOV), 6 (JSON), 7 (HTML SPA), 8 (Cobertura XML).

// Sibling re-exports are not currently supported; consumers import
// directly (e.g. `use coverage::emit::lcov::write_lcov`).
